Description: Isolated Oh My Zsh GX profile and pinned herdr workspace manager
 Provides gx-zsh and a package-managed herdr entry point. User configuration
 is created only when the ordinary user runs the launcher. System shell
 settings, existing dotfiles and user data are not changed by dpkg scripts.
